SCOPE AND FUNCTIONALITY (TOOL VS. INPUTS)
This software functions as an automatic ROM porting tool designed to unpack, 
modify, and repack partition images (e.g., replacing a stock 'system.img' 
inside a 'super.img'). It accepts various .img inputs, which may include 
closed-source OEM ROMs or open-source custom ROMs (GSIs). 
This License strictly governs THIS TOOL (the scripts, algorithms, and patching 
logic) and the mandatory signatures injected into the output. It does not 
claim ownership over the third-party OS images used as inputs. Users are 
solely responsible for the legality of the ROMs they choose to modify and 
distribute.

